    <item>
      <title>Kubernetes不会修复破碎团队，只会把问题放大</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/Kubernetes%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%9A%E4%BF%AE%E5%A4%8D%E7%A0%B4%E7%A2%8E%E5%9B%A2%E9%98%9F%E5%8F%AA%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%8A%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E6%94%BE%E5%A4%A7/</link>
